+# Tool input validation
+
+| Field  | Value                |
+| ------ | -------------------- |
+| Issue  | re-cinq/HALEngine#37 |
+| Status | Draft                |
+
+The registry validates inputs against the schema supplied with each tool before invoking its executor.
+
+## Contract
+
+- Required properties, types and enums are enforced; invalid input returns a descriptive tool result without exposing values, while valid input and extra properties pass through unchanged. ([validated by: rejects invalid input and passes valid input through unchanged](../../src/orchestration/tools/registry.acceptance.test.ts#L4))
+- An uncompilable static schema fails registration with the tool name. ([validated by: rejects an invalid static schema when the tool is registered](../../src/orchestration/tools/registry.acceptance.test.ts#L36))
+- A dynamic definition is validated against its current schema on each call. ([validated by: validates each call against the current dynamic schema](../../src/orchestration/tools/registry.acceptance.test.ts#L43))
